    <item>
      <title>Orbit 2026.11.23.1919</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 19:19:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202611231919</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2026.11.23.1919</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:releaseNotesLink>https://github.com/siosphere/orbit-updates/releases/tag/v202611231919</sparkle:releaseNotesLink>
      <orbit:note>On Mac, you can drag spaces to reorder them and move tabs, folders, or split rows to another space by menu or by dropping on its icon.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>Opening a favorite or pinned tab from the sidebar on iOS now reliably brings up the browser, and Esc exits full-screen pages on Mac.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>Returning a video from the floating player to its tab no longer causes the app to briefly freeze or stutter.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>Clearing browsing history now also empties Reopen Closed Tab, so cleared pages can't be brought back with the keyboard shortcut.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:chromium>156.0.8078.100</orbit:chromium>
